# Title: Arbitrary File Download Via IMEWDBLD.EXE
# ID: 863218bd-c7d0-4c52-80cd-0a96c09f54af
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel
# Date: 2023-11-09
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.stealth, attack.t1218
# Description: Detects usage of "IMEWDBLD.exe" to download arbitrary files
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((process.command_line:*http://* OR process.command_line:*https://*)) AND ((process.executable:*\\IMEWDBLD.exe) OR (process.pe.original_file_name:"imewdbld.exe")))
